menu "PhotoFrame Firmware"

    config PHOTOFRAME_OTA
        bool "Over-the-air firmware updates"
        default y
        help
            Builds two OTA app slots and the GitHub release updater. Disable it
            to get a single factory app slot instead: on boards that keep photos
            in internal flash, the freed slot goes to the storage partition, and
            firmware updates have to be flashed over USB.

endmenu
